A new mailing list was created to discuss frame buffer device related
development:

        linux-fbdev@vu.union.edu

To subscribe to linux-fbdev, send the following in the body (not
the subject line) of an email message to "Majordomo@vu.union.edu":

        subscribe linux-fbdev

This will subscribe the account from which you send the message to
the linux-fbdev list.

If you wish to subscribe another address instead (such as a local
redistribution list), you can use a command of the form:

        subscribe linux-fbdev other-address@your_site.your_net

Special thanks to Rob Hagopian <hagopiar@vuser.vu.union.edu> for setting up the
list.

Greetings,

